WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:18.920
Well, my birth date is very special to me: November 22, 1990, so 11, 22, and 90.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:24.500
I feel like they also have a combination of very important numbers, like a code, something like that.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:35.920
1 is a very important number, 2 as well, within somewhat ancient symbolism.

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:39.640
They're very important numbers, numbers of a nice scale.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.160
9, which is from 90, is also a really nice number.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.440
So, combined they also make other numbers, which I don't want to talk about right now,

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.140
because we'd spend the whole night on that numerical craziness.

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:56.320
But yes, among those, my favorite is 22.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:25.780
Thank you.
